    <item><verbatim|YM.Next.Rank.Market.{Purchases,lands,Purchases.samples,
    Purchases.monitor_tends}>, <verbatim|Lean/YM/Next/RANK/Bought.lean>:
    exact nine geometric/lift clauses and arrays; corrected cylinder
    coefficient for nonempty modes; root bound before cutoff limits; ordered
    mesh then period limits of the lifted observable; polynomial free-profile
    factor times gap.

    <item><verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.rated>,
    <verbatim|Lean/YM/MergeProof/Powder.lean>: imports the frequent supplier
